  "description": "Opt-in embeddable hosting library for the Orleans.Lattice Explorer Blazor Server web head. AddLatticeExplorerWeb(...) registers the Razor components, shared explorer UI, state-API connection seam, configuration and capability stores, the Backups, Access, and Schema areas, and the cookie / data-protection auth plumbing; MapLatticeExplorer(...) maps the interactive server components, static assets, and server-side sign-in / sign-out endpoints under a configurable base path so a consumer can co-host the read-only explorer inside their own ASP.NET app.",
